    "font" : "GlyphLessFont",
    "font size" : 5.833,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "_    By the laws of this country,  said Mr Justice Blackburn, be-"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 11,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 18.8, 457.727, 203.655, 471.617 ],
    "font" : "GlyphLessFont",
    "font size" : 6.417,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "faith. There has been much discussion as to whether, in districts"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 63,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 212.2, 465.428, 395.047, 471.07 ],
    "font" : "GlyphLessFont",
    "font size" : 5.639,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "ginning at Magna Carta and getting more and more established,"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
