    "font" : "GlyphLessFont",
    "font size" : 6.417,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "of Martial Army Acts. (2) As applied to the enemy. (3) HERTS As applied to rebels. (4) As applied to civilian subjects who are not in rebellion, but in a district where the ordinary course of civil life cannot be maintained owing to war or rebellion."
